==Russian==
===Etymology===
From Turkish '''[[kara#Turkish|kara]]''' ([[black]]) + '''[[taş#Turkish|taş]]''' ([[stone]]).

Although possibly a borrowing from Turkish, it is more probable that the word was acquired from one of the first pencil manufacturers distributing in Russia, Caran d'Ache.

===Noun===
'''карандаш''' (karandáš) {{m}}

#[[pencil]]

